      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I don't know if this counts a valid reproduction but I've encountered worlds which also exhibit the same bug (Crash on leave) in 896\nWorlds involved in report\nBlue-Kun's Home (My home world, so every test will start from here, Also used as a destination)\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_8fa9426e-34f8-4b38-9137-7ab631f80242\nFFCR (One of the test destination worlds)\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_59fa7101-92fe-4a46-b1df-4746305d3f3a\nThe Short Pub (One of the test destination worlds)\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_168b30a6-4992-4e16-8ca4-cb1729133128\nRidge Racer (Some worlds crash when leaving this one)\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_d22a0013-b93e-4415-b060-bb6f8511bcba\nClub Despair (Crash on leave encountered)\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_dd3a6317-67eb-4c0b-9e19-74c55b3e40ab\nThe Phoenix v1.5 (Crash on leave encountered)\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_2d7404d7-0ad9-461c-a78c-bb153ecfe970\nTests performed;\nRidge Racer -> Blue-Kuns home Safe\nRidge Racer -> The Short Pub Safe\nRidge Racer -> FFCR Crashes\nRidge Racer -> Blue-Kuns home->FFCR Crashes\nClub Despair -> The Short Pub Crashes\nClub Despair -> FFCR Crashes\nClub Despair -> Blue-Kun's Home Crashes\nBar Clover Cherry -> Blue-Kun's Home Crashes\nThe Phoenix v1.5 -> Blue-Kun's Home Crashes\nAny transition not listed have not been tested (i.e. Bar Clover Cherry -> FFCR may crash but hasn't been checked)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
